---
/**
 * About section. Replaces the Hugo about.html partial.
 */
import SectionImage from "./SectionImage.astro";
import aboutImg from "../images/about/about.jpg";
---

<section id="about">
  <header>
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>
  <SectionImage src={aboutImg} alt="Marcela Viola training in the gym" />
  <article class="content">
    <p>
      I'm a holistic coach experienced in developing tailored training and
      nutrition solutions to help you achieve a thriving healthy lifestyle.
    </p>

    <p>
      For the past 20 years, I've been an aerialist, a yoga teacher, a handstands
      practitioner, a gym rat, a vegetarian, a vegan (very very briefly), and a
      protein junkie.
    </p>

    <p>
      I have been an entrepreneur for over 10 years. I founded my own company in
      Amsterdam leading group classes for kids and adults, workshops, and
      consulting for circus companies around Europe, USA, and Norway.
    </p>

    <p>
      I recently co-founded my coaching app in Singapore where I run my personal
      trainer practice. I'm also a Milan Pole Dance Studio coach for group and
      private aerial, mobility, and conditioning classes.
    </p>

    <p>
      Through my own trial and error and the experiences I collected from my
      students and clients, I learned to combine the best of the many
      disciplines, training methods, diets, and habits to optimize a healthy
      lifestyle that fits you and your unique routine.
    </p>

    <p>I specialize in:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Strength and resistance training</li>
      <li>Mobility and flexibility</li>
      <li>Nutrition Coaching</li>
      <li>Habit and Lifestyle Coaching</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      I work side by side with my clients making every decision together and
      learning to pivot and adapt as we progress towards our goals.
    </p>
  </article>
</section>
